\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs20 Scottplotz\par
\par
Scottplotz turns data you post into a PNG chart. After installation it listens on port 5240.\par
\par
The installer copies the program into the folder you choose and adds a Start menu shortcut. You can also start Scottplotz when you sign in. The installer allows chart requests from the local network subnet through Windows Firewall.\par
\par
Logs and settings stay in your local application data folder. Uninstall removes the program, the shortcut, the startup entry, and the firewall rule. It leaves your logs and settings in place.\par
\par
This software is provided as-is, without warranty. You may use, copy, and share it.\par
